    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wall Dodging 3D is a casual game where you play as a blue ball and you\u00a0try to make it to the end of each level without hitting a wall. If you hit a wall then you start back from the beginning of the level, and if you make it to the end of the level without hitting a wall then you move onto the next level. Every level gets challenging as you progress where there are a total of 100 levels in the game. Do you think you have what it takes to beat all 100 levels?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in development with a release expected to be around Q1 or Q2 of 2026 on PC and Mac. Playable demo coming soon. Also coming soon to mobile after the PC and Mac release\u00a0with release date\u00a0TBD.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wall Dodging 3D is a casual game where you play as a blue ball and you\u00a0try to make it to the end of each level without hitting a wall. If you hit a wall then you start back from the beginning of the level, and if you make it to the end of the level without hitting a wall then you move onto the next level. Every level gets challenging as you progress where there are a total of 100 levels in the game. Do you think you have what it takes to beat all 100 levels?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in development with a release expected to be around Q1 or Q2 of 2026 on PC and Mac. Playable demo coming soon. Also coming soon to mobile after the PC and Mac release\u00a0with release date\u00a0TBD.</p>",
